/Producer <6954657874AE20352E312E3220A9323030302D323031312031543358542042564241>
/Author (Roberts, Elvy B.)
/Keywords (*ARMY OPERATIONS;ATTRITION;CAMBODIA;CLOSE SUPPORT;COUNTERINSURGENCY;DEPLOYMENT;ENEMY PERSONNEL;HELICOPTERS;JUNGLES;LOGISTICS;MILITARY TACTICS;NIGHT WARFARE;TACTICAL AIR SUPPORT;VIETNAM)
/Subject (This report reflects the operational environment of the 1st Cavalry Division and personal experiences. The story of the divisions operations for the past year has been characterized by an expansion of the screening role into an operation which has driven the enemy main forces steadily back against the Cambodian border.)
/Title (Senior Officer Debriefing Report: 1st Cavalry Division, Period 23 April 1969 through 5 May 1970)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/AD0509767.pdf)
